rules/KANDER-KANBAN-RULES.md:50:kander list [--mobile] [backlog|todo|working|review|done|archived|trash]
rules/KANDER-KANBAN-RULES.md:53:kander move <task-id> <backlog|todo|working|review|done|archived|trash> [--expect-revision <revision>]
